 # Project rules
 
 This project declares no rules beyond its README.
+
+## Decisions taken
+
+- **Cancellation refund** (`cancel(bookingId, at)`): the school gave no refund policy, so by default the
+  customer gets the full booking total back when cancelled at or before the start of the rental, and
+  nothing once it has started. `at` must be on the hour UTC. A booking can be cancelled only once, and a
+  cancelled booking no longer holds its equipment. Change the refund line in `cancel` if the school
+  states a different policy.
